# The rippling 6x6 grid (flat base; the scene rewrites z with a sine ripple
# every frame before projecting).
# Source: apps/zig/scenes/fallen_angels.zig (grid_vertices, grid_segments).
# Original: Golden Axe crack intro, coded by Proteus for The Fallen Angels
# (The Empire) on the Atari ST.
# Each quad a b c d is one closed polyline, drawn a-b, b-c, c-d, d-a.
# Vertices are f32-exact: they parse back to the original table's bits.
